      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The above-entitled matter came on for oral argument before the Supreme Court of the United States at 11:04 a.m."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Petitioner",
      "case_id": "2001-00-1307",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "91bdfbaa1e29e43dc183fd67bd4fd8ec90d460138a29431c44166f5fcf50df52",
      "evidence_id": "ev-91bdfbaa1e29-0000-0001",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 3,
        "start": 3
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Congress enacted the Coal Act to prevent the collapse of a multi-employer, private health care system that had promised health care benefits to retired coal miners. Miners were in danger of losing their benefits as coal operators were selling their operations and dissolving and going out of business and shifting responsibility for their employees to other employers that were in the multi-employer health care system."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
      "case_id": "2001-00-1307",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "91bdfbaa1e29e43dc183fd67bd4fd8ec90d460138a29431c44166f5fcf50df52",
      "evidence_id": "ev-91bdfbaa1e29-0000-0004",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 4,
        "start": 4
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "QUESTION: Mr. Wolfson, even the dissenting judge in the court of appeals didn't buy that."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice O'Connor",
      "case_id": "2001-00-1307",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "91bdfbaa1e29e43dc183fd67bd4fd8ec90d460138a29431c44166f5fcf50df52",
      "evidence_id": "ev-91bdfbaa1e29-0000-0002",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 5,
        "start": 5
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "QUESTION: Mr. Wolfson, can I interrupt you for a second on -- just on the word described? Does the word described have any meaning other than simply refer to -- insofar as it refers to any of the -- any of the entities described in subparagraphs (i), (ii), and (iii)? Does it do anything other than, in fact, identify each?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Wolfson",
      "case_id": "2001-00-1307",
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "document_hash": "91bdfbaa1e29e43dc183fd67bd4fd8ec90d460138a29431c44166f5fcf50df52",
      "evidence_id": "ev-91bdfbaa1e29-0000-0003",
      "kind": "fact",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 10,
        "start": 10
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The Court has done that. The Court has done that. I think --"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "United Mine Workers of America Combined Benefit Fund",
      "case_id": "2001-00-1307",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "91bdfbaa1e29e43dc183fd67bd4fd8ec90d460138a29431c44166f5fcf50df52",
      "evidence_id": "ev-91bdfbaa1e29-0001-0000",
      "kind": "amicus_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 19,
        "start": 19
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "There are several things that are not in dispute"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "United Mine Workers of America Combined Benefit Fund",
      "case_id": "2001-00-1307",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "91bdfbaa1e29e43dc183fd67bd4fd8ec90d460138a29431c44166f5fcf50df52",
      "evidence_id": "ev-91bdfbaa1e29-0001-0001",
      "kind": "amicus_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 20,
        "start": 20
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "First of all, Congress did not say that the successors of signatory operators are excluded from liability. Congress could have said that. It did not."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Mr. Woodrum",
      "case_id": "2001-00-1307",
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "document_hash": "91bdfbaa1e29e43dc183fd67bd4fd8ec90d460138a29431c44166f5fcf50df52",
      "evidence_id": "ev-91bdfbaa1e29-0002-0001",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 40,
        "start": 40
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "MR. WOODRUM: No, Your Honor, it doesn't necessarily include that. That's the way the commissioner -- that's the position the commissioner has taken."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Mr. Woodrum",
      "case_id": "2001-00-1307",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "document_hash": "91bdfbaa1e29e43dc183fd67bd4fd8ec90d460138a29431c44166f5fcf50df52",
      "evidence_id": "ev-91bdfbaa1e29-0003-0000",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 53,
        "start": 53
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Mr. Woodrum said there's no harm caused by affirming the Fourth Circuit. But that -- even if nobody loses their benefits tomorrow, as a result of affirming, Congress did view that as a less desirable alternative."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2001-00-1307",
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "document_hash": "91bdfbaa1e29e43dc183fd67bd4fd8ec90d460138a29431c44166f5fcf50df52",
      "evidence_id": "ev-91bdfbaa1e29-0003-0001",
      "kind": "fact",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 53,
        "start": 53
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "because Congress did not want to go to the Abandoned Mine Fund or to a pro rata exaction on the other signatory operators unless that was necessary as a last resort."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Chief Justice Rehnquist",
      "case_id": "2001-00-1307",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "document_hash": "91bdfbaa1e29e43dc183fd67bd4fd8ec90d460138a29431c44166f5fcf50df52",
      "evidence_id": "ev-91bdfbaa1e29-0003-0002",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 53,
        "start": 53
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "CHIEF JUSTICE REHNQUIST: The case is submitted."
    }
  ],
